{% include "partials/power-seeds.njk" %}

<p>Block 2b tells you what to do at each of its nine steps. This page shows you what your paper should look like when each step is done. One frame per step, in order, using the same starter as the back of the printed checklist: the sea evaporates into the air. Open the frame for the step you are on, check your paper against it, and move on. Every frame ends with the same "Done when" line as the block page, so you are never guessing whether you are finished.</p>

</div>

